  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Política|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(18 fotos) Inma Navarro Mor ha ganado el jam&oacute;n ib&eacute;rico del sorteo especial de diciembre del Mercado Municipal de Onda, entre aquellas personas que utilizan la tarjeta de fidelizaci&oacute;n en las paradas.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/IMG_4531.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Marta Gim&eacute;nez Mart&iacute;nez, Mar&iacute;a Teresa Ballester Aguilar y Emilia Manuel Fr&iacute;as se llevar&aacute;n un jam&oacute;n de Teruel cada una. Los premios se entregar&aacute;n el jueves 21 de diciembre.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/IMG_4517.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">El sorteo se ha celebrado este mi&eacute;rcoles, 13 de diciembre, junto </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/IMG_4557.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">a una nueva sesi&oacute;n de cocina en directo, en la que Julio Segura, del restaurant El M&oacute;n de Julio, ha preparado un delicioso flan de turr&oacute;n.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4516.jpg\" alt=\"img_4516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4517.jpg\" alt=\"img_4517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4519.jpg\" alt=\"img_4519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4520.jpg\" alt=\"img_4520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4522.jpg\" alt=\"img_4522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4531.jpg\" alt=\"img_4531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4534.jpg\" alt=\"img_4534\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4536.jpg\" alt=\"img_4536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4539.jpg\" alt=\"img_4539\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4540.jpg\" alt=\"img_4540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4544.jpg\" alt=\"img_4544\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4546.jpg\" alt=\"img_4546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigdesembrecuinaendirectemercatonda/img_4547.jpg\" alt=\"img_4547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8